@startuml
class Session {
  internal identity
  activity code
}
class Round
class Question
class Blank
class QuestionGroup
class Team
class Participant
class Submission {
  backend arrival order / rank
}
class Result
Session "1" o-- "0..*" Round
Round "0..*" --> "0..1" Question
Round "0..*" --> "0..1" QuestionGroup
Question "1" o-- "0..*" Blank
QuestionGroup "0..1" o-- "1..*" Question
Session "1" o-- "0..*" Team
Team "1" o-- "0..*" Participant
Round "1" --> "0..*" Submission
Team "1" --> "0..*" Submission
note on link
Each Submission is associated with exactly one Team and one Round.
A Question may be retried across multiple Rounds.
A Question may be standalone or belong to one QuestionGroup.
A Round targets exactly one Question XOR one QuestionGroup.
Question may have 0..* Blanks per FR-005.
Session may have no Rounds or Teams when created.
end note
Submission "1" --> "0..1" Result
Round "1" --> "0..1" Result
note right of Session
Activity Code is distinct from
Session internal identity.
Session represents one activity.
end note
note bottom of QuestionGroup
A group of questions differs from
multiple blanks in one question.
Each Round targets exactly one Question
or one QuestionGroup.
A repeated question uses a new Round.
Submissions are ranked by backend arrival order.
A Result refers to the winning Submission.
The new Result replaces the prior result.
end note
@enduml
